<title>UK: SocGen sets warrants on U.S. dollar/mark rate.</title>
<headline>SocGen sets warrants on U.S. dollar/mark rate.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale Effekten GmbH has issued four million American-style call and put warrants, in four equal tranches, on the U.S. dollar/mark rate, lead manager Societe Generale SA, Frankfurt said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS		   STRIKE	    ISS PRICE</p>
<p> CALL USD/PUT DEM A     1.79		 7.04 DEM</p>
<p> PUT USD/CALL DEM B     1.70		10.25 DEM</p>
<p> CALL USD/PUT DEM C     1.75		 5.24 DEM</p>
<p> CALL USD/PUT DEM D     1.80		 3.84 DEM</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 20.MAR.97-15.JUN.98   PAYDATE	19.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT DDF BER	     MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
